  "description": "The default implementation of Cirreum's domain-centric application model — the runtime-agnostic engine behind the contracts in Cirreum.Contracts. Provides the Conductor (Dispatcher, Publisher, intercepts, builders), the Authorization pillar's evaluators / grant cache / role scanner / FluentValidation validators, the cache services, State, Presence, RemoteServices, and FileSystem implementations, plus the AddDomainServices registration. The cross-host triad: Cirreum.Kernel (primitives) → Cirreum.Contracts (contracts) → Cirreum.Domain (implementation).",
